  "paper": "paper_1a",
  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Isotope <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"_{3}^{6}\"></span>X has a rest mass of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span>. What is the magnitude of the average binding energy per nucleon for <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"_{3}^{6}\"></span>X?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{(a - (3m_{p} + 3m_{n}))c^{2}}{6}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{((3m_{p} + 3m_{n}) - a)c^{2}}{6}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{(a - (3m_{p} + 3m_{n}))c^{2}}{3}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{((3m_{p} + 3m_{n}) - a)c^{2}}{3}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
